# aget Project Rules

Read and follow `AGENTS.md`. It is the shared source of truth for this repository.

Before task work, read:

- `project.md`
- `workpads/WORKPADS.md`
- Active workpad `tasks.md`, `knowledge.md`, and `references.md`

Do not start implementation until the research phase has produced an MVP architecture proposal and the user has reviewed it.

Do not commit or push without explicit user confirmation.
